        "Description": "Three Triad associates have been skimming money out of the front laundromat run by the families in a vein attempt at starting their own syndicate within Chongqing.\r\rThe &quot;owner&quot; of the shell laundromat is one Junjie Chang, an elderly career criminal who can be found wandering the neon streets or neandering in his laundromat/HQ.\r\rThe other two enforcers are orphaned children he took under his wing some 20 years ago, they are highly trained to spot suspicious behavior and know all street guards.",
